WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.657
WHERE is the most familiar location for subqueries
The inner result

00:00:05.684 --> 00:00:12.567
can become a benchmark a membership set an existence
condition or a set comparison The

00:00:12.594 --> 00:00:18.253
final job is always Boolean should the current outer
row remain That

00:00:18.279 --> 00:00:21.411
is why many subquery patterns appear naturally in
WHERE
